.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100371","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100371.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100371.patch","merged_at":"2025-01-28T15:08:55Z"},"body":"The path to the bus layout is now saved as a UID in `project.godot`, which led to some problems when overriding the default path:\r\n\r\n- Name of layout shown as UID, for example \"Layout: y3vhn3cy58cf\".\r\n- An error is output: \"Cannot navigate to 'uid://y3vhn3cy58cf' as it has not been found in the file system!\".\r\n\r\n**Before:**\r\n\r\n[](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5c63f403-e0e2-4e2d-b3ce-df19ed86d2eb)\r\n\r\n\r\n**After:**\r\n`ResourceUID::ensure_path()` is now used before trying to load the layout.\r\nI also deduplicated the loading code, which fixes an inconsistency where the layout file name in some cases was not prefixed with \"Layout:\".","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100371/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocke